<description>&lt;p&gt;Explosive attacks continue around Damascus, with a car bomb in a suburb killing a father and his daughter and another car bomb near the capital killing two people including a child. An improvised explosive device in Jaramana killed two civilians, one of them a young girl, and injured others. A separate car explosion in the Damascus countryside wounded two people. The violence reflects ongoing sectarian and insurgent tensions in the capital region. The conflict caused 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxNLXNycnVSRjdCSmM2QTlSQ3FFcnd0Nnp4MkcxN2RrX1NHeERWVThvSEZyYi1saUlaZWhxNjJUak1RZ3NhdlB4NjN1VGtVdjY4a3lsaDJyVkU3ejEyNzNaTDdLX1Z5YXd4TFNCSS1JaFc2Qy1rVmF0QUVJTUw5Ym1zblpnTWc1UlA3amlyQ1U1TTNINHVUa1FOODdjYmtpTS1vc3h2ZVVVQi1EZzNTUHMwNW5tWHRHdzg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera Centre for Studies&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxOellsd3Vqak9sMFhiX1BMTk91Wm1jQUw5ckVmQW04T0VVR3V0eXpURUV3Vkg1cDF5aWo1REhxYVhrQlpqWHhTY3dGYjUwbFRYTWlmX0xZSFZyN3Rzdk9sMmJJV3R0X3ZCNG5xTzlfeTZoa3dLYW1sNlc0clR2c3Uwb0gwTFUyX0N0V2VZNURzZTQydksybFl2dC13NFJsSWljd3lIYUJ3?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxPek9GT0ZkYmpFNmJUQ3d4Yl9qZUZiMk40R3hqQU5teGxMdXJOSTBFbG1vS3VlaFdsR0F5cFY2TUM4aDFDZmc2MnVWcHVqb3BYc1o0UWU1UEZTN1Y0UHZtX0NQWXZiRmh6ZDZmSWNBajRrRFFtWDdHdU1janRDbGxFMFFDazR0QUlwaFJqWV9SQ1FtY0U?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New Arab&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE5fbWVPSWNjbDRPLUNib2VTWHR2NVlLdVpua1B2Nnp3Z3gx